# Command menu: down to Magic, open it, wait, close, back up to Attack (HUD animation). UNSAFE as is: the
# menu remembers its cursor; on 2026-11-10 this ended in a Drive into Valor Form. Check the selection first.
300 -
150 DOWN     # Attack -> Magic
400 -
150 A        # open the Magic list
900 -
150 B        # close
400 -
150 UP       # back to Attack
500 -
